  <item>
    <title>006.下一个以美食爆火的城市包是贵阳的！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66833bef077b88831b9157ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66833bef077b88831b9157ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 02 Jul 2024 03:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>嗨嗨嗨朋友们</span></strong><span>，想死你们啦！最近</span><strong><span>章鱼</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>人字拖</span></strong><span>进行了一次双人旅行，这次旅行不仅仅是地理定义上的旅行，同时也是味蕾和心灵之旅。三毛说过：“</span><strong><span>旅行真正的快乐不在于目的地，而在于它的过程</span></strong><span>。”</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;旅行的时候时间会被放慢，自由会充斥你的灵魂，未知会在你的想象里跳跃，心灵会被反复洗涤。每一个旅行中掉落的碎片都会被慢慢拼凑，一个新的灵魂将会被雕琢塑造…</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;这次旅行播客里你会听到</span><strong><span>J人</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>P人</span></strong><span>对待同一件事情不同的感受，你会云品尝到冲击味蕾的美味食物，你会感受到自然的魅力，你会发现旅行中的小确幸。</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;这次我们去到的城市是</span><strong><span>贵州省贵阳市！</span></strong><span>贵阳对于我们两个人来说都是很陌生的城市，很幸运这次刚好是我们，也刚好是来到</span><strong><span>贵阳</span></strong><span>，因此我们被贵阳的魅力狠狠惊艳到！即使我们在</span><strong><span>贵阳</span></strong><span>的时间很短，但是我们已经想要来</span><strong><span>贵阳</span></strong><span>养老了哈哈哈哈哈…这几天我们的味蕾被反复满足，又被反复惊艳，我想对于每一个热爱美食的人来说，旅行中吃到让自己热血沸腾的美食是多么令人开心的事啊！</span><strong><span>酸汤牛肉火锅、夺夺粉火锅、烙锅、豆米火锅</span></strong><span>……不说了口水已经要流下来了</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;那么，现在就跟着章鱼和人字拖的脚步一起感受</span><strong><span>贵阳</span></strong><span>吧~</span><br><span></span><strong><span>【戳一戳时间】精心配图~</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 贵阳第一杯去茶山直接惊呆二人味蕾</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrzXOFjSgYSvqdaMZ4MYNa820r16.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a>酸汤牛肉火锅第一次看到青菜随便拿的阵仗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltbjoSXjoZvHaJMyCETGrMAcI08J.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 夜游白宫寻觅最佳机位</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoEjEZI1u15DnwckmmKdpmSf9yYq.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 人字拖富家千金图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrwX1PYzr99kPj3sh7EdVt5XM5S_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 异世界入口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgWUNvEU_TjXn2Zur5guc9DNfyB9.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 宵夜香酥鸭麻麻安排</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 烙锅狠狠把住章鱼人字拖的胃，狠狠炫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmh2m3BmQ4zx7xykXtIr3BBXxKDQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a> 章鱼激情开麦演绎贵州山歌</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 大雨中结识牛打滚和小舒冰浆</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpoQ3xOD76p_JhCGWYEsbVJ_ZjV2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 大雨过后霓虹的世界</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/licwFdCSfQu2vNzuiuSvu_6qC4G6.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljsehJdK7_KinZaBPqNKZLKQ3Yf_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 人生照片轻松拿捏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lidFBYhJolRcpiuwncO18vIvl75s.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 蛋包洋芋香晕章鱼辣哭人字拖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkT6C3c5ojEVDUtgYVfQYwiRTpBn.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> 路边随机偶遇锅巴糍粑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhYTDu5AbFLCDJTbwhM9pfM0B7TM.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> 勇敢尝试贵州特色刺梨去茶山难喝哭二人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicjrV8w9SMe74QpUdz59CbrYOqL.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 人字拖被板筋盖饭勾引坚持深夜食</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 恶大头糯米饭，但忘记备注不要折耳根</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi8E_ClbVVjRkPdx1eDYxurF2bT4.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a> 龙老太夺夺粉火锅没人不爱，吃的二人发饭晕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrBT0v8BafI1Vn4qRT0LVUdYhcbk.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">44:19</a> 闹中取静的神秘瀑布，堪称小黄果树（不是）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvSTrPT_rzfAU4hGfy5YFw_T63uO.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvNnmgHDnQ0wANUYdJU-LTmUD4q.jfif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lknSpUs7jiNQC0LUMSzeUl85TEx3.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">48:40</a> 生活感气息浓郁的小区，让人字拖和章鱼要来养老</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpySPt80AHHG3FaIMJUMa2Vv-SDt.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2969">49:29</a> 章鱼最爱的豆米火锅，喜菜爱好者天堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lluqkGbg8-brCwlm_OAI1SjcJ1Js.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhu72585ymTtuxBX6atqJNQkrkAP.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a> 最佳散步路线去甲秀楼一城一照片神图诞生地</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lunbz02HQx321VB3QDfC0NQCxo_V.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> 宵夜女王人字拖喜滋滋嗦素粉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpvyqDQxYgoH5s7wD6j0Yql0VT8d.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> 豆花渎鱼店的布丁才是人生布丁</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2XSOzJ9rPy-wE6iW5wCMBYhZDH.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3235">53:55</a> 人字拖吃安顺裹卷被pua</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnnj_zbw7EH1ve6CuQy1UR3Adfu3.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3271">54:31</a> 缆车前面上演速度与激情</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltI8b0jSChlCH1ylPmMiVK4mc88x.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> 与吗喽共游黔灵山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liN8nzGlK0C2tFRRA5YwjpiRl7wy.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3338">55:38</a> 肉沫豆花饭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtssxZH56R8XbAR1NTVKlroz_c-x.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3348">55:48</a> 分道扬镳后人字拖独食肉饼西瓜</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3369">56:09</a> 章鱼演唱会氛围妆造</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmoyLObnZ8-wUzOyqmJ5DsAGggD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3376">56:16</a> 步行二里地+爬一个山坡终于到达</span><strong><span>JJ20世界巡回演唱会</span></strong><span>现场美美嗨唱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneXm5UaXEVFE5wDP0dM5IqoAc7-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 酒店狂炫贵阳最后的宵夜杨婆婆烤肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgmdn7s9MWkr8NcVrZKT2YfmRWnh.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3680">01:01:20</a> 章鱼最后和去茶山洋芋饭小小约会</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FluG5k1X6Jzx42CdFd_-fJvOAdOA.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqhwmou3VeLg286D_aHRFOi6-OtW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>贵阳美食包好吃的！！！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span><br><span></span><strong><span>How Sweet-New Jeans（뉴진스）</span></strong><br><span></span><br><span>【滴滴我们】</span><br><span></span><br><span>除了在小宇宙，还可以在苹果播客找到我们，你的订阅、评论，是对我们最大的鼓励！nia~</span></p>]]></description>
