  <item>
    <title>005. 乘坐童年时光机：装瞎、装死、演技大爆炸，金马奖频频提名！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659fd3fad5aa5d8c2cdf472</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659fd3fad5aa5d8c2cdf472</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是六一儿童节，祝各位大朋友小朋友节日快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是一期爆笑、轻松、温暖的童年奇葩故事分享，其中不乏各种天马行空的幻想、治愈满分的场景、感觉天要塌了的至暗时刻，甚至还有隐藏二十年的终极秘密......</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望本期节目可以让你想到曾经那个小小的自己，那个极具想象力的自己，其实现在也还在我们身体里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>用童年心态指导成年生活吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的小red书号</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63592a83000000001901c6f8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=622c7369000000002102bd48&amp;apptime=1716384823" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63592a83000000001901c6f8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=622c7369000000002102bd48&amp;apptime=1716384823"><span>@nia来nia</span></a><span>去有我们的童年照片哦，可以吧唧咬一口。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【戳戳时间】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="175">02:55</a> 章鱼背跳皮筋口诀“马兰开花二十一二八二五六...”根本停不下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 强烈建议成年人组队玩一次老鹰抓小鸡！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a> 把书包抛到天上，我就是班里最有孩子气的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 谁懂这种友谊困局，懦弱的小孩从小就被强势的玩伴吸引</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 也太超前了！不要笑挑战、恋爱乙游在小学宿舍就玩过了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a> 小区里童话般的仙境大树，坐在树杈上建立属于自己的房间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> 摘树叶自制可名贵可名贵的茶叶，采茶天后非你莫属</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 趁妈爸上班假扮西域公主被迫去和亲，cp大乱炖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 每天睡前表演在豪车前晕倒，从此被带到大别墅生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 洗澡装晕、眼屎糊眼装瞎，把自己送进医院打一个月吊瓶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 为了偷吃冰糕，我在姥爷锁在厕所里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 逃学练习唱歌，坚信自己要出道的使命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2549">42:29</a> 一年级打碎老师的杯子，童年的至暗时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> 跟着学习好的人偷懒，就不会被记名字，我真聪明</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Window - Galdive</span></p><span></span><p><span>天涯 - 任贤齐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Reality - Richard Sanderson</span></p><span></span><p><span>Everytime -CHEN/Punch</span></p><span></span><p><span>【滴滴我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了在小宇宙，还可以在苹果播客找到我们，你的订阅、评论，是对我们最大的鼓励！nia！</span></p>]]></description>
